; Behaviour block: a water drop, and the sprite blocks of the projectiles (kind 9, rooms 15 and 19)
;
; Used by the drops that fall from the roof of Gloomy tunels and Underground river (cyan, attribute $45). This kind does
; not have the layout of #R$93D3: after the 5 header bytes (hit box and slot +$15, as there) comes the sprite description
; read by #R$B56D: +5 attribute, +6 height of the falling drop (2-pixel units; the width of the sprites is 2 bytes), +7
; word graphics of the hanging drop frame 0, +9 word frame 1, +$0B word the falling drop.
; .
; The rest of the entry holds the sprite blocks (attribute, then the graphics) of the projectiles of the other kinds:
; the entity templates at #R$BC92 point at them. #R$94F0 the fireballs of Satan, #R$94F3 the seeds of the plants,
; #R$94F6 the arrows of the stone heads, #R$94F9 and #R$94FC the arrows of the archers (flying left and right), #R$94FF
; the splash of a fish (3 sprites).
@label=BehaviourDrop
b$94E3 DEFB $00,$03,$03,$05,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right (2-pixel units); slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $94E8 DEFB $45,$04  ; attribute, height of the falling drop
 $94EA DEFW $EF53    ; hanging drop, frame 0
 $94EC DEFW $EF55    ; hanging drop, frame 1
 $94EE DEFW $F357    ; falling drop
@label=SpriteBlockFireball
 $94F0 DEFB $44      ; fireball of Satan: attribute
 $94F1 DEFW $EF30    ; sprite
@label=SpriteBlockSeed
 $94F3 DEFB $43      ; seed of a plant: attribute
 $94F4 DEFW $EF30    ; sprite
@label=SpriteBlockStoneArrow
 $94F6 DEFB $44      ; arrow of a stone head: attribute
 $94F7 DEFW $EF32    ; sprite
@label=SpriteBlockArrowLeft
 $94F9 DEFB $47      ; arrow of an archer, flying left: attribute
 $94FA DEFW $EF34    ; sprite
@label=SpriteBlockArrowRight
 $94FC DEFB $47      ; arrow of an archer, flying right: attribute
 $94FD DEFW $EF36    ; sprite
@label=SpriteBlockSplash
 $94FF DEFB $45      ; splash: attribute
 $9500 DEFW $F759    ; sprite, frame 0
 $9502 DEFW $F75B    ; sprite, frame 1
 $9504 DEFW $F75D    ; sprite, frame 2
